WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.478
Which cloud matters at every step:
the sign-in authority, the Graph host,

2
00:00:04.478 --> 00:00:07.609
the Azure environment,
the token audience and the

3
00:00:07.609 --> 00:00:10.663
Graph PowerShell environment
all have to agree.

4
00:00:10.663 --> 00:00:15.209
For a GCC tenant like this estate's,
Learn says apps keep using the

5
00:00:15.209 --> 00:00:20.100
worldwide endpoints, so every value
on the slide is the worldwide one.

6
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.545
Tokens for one cloud
don't work in another,

7
00:00:22.545 --> 00:00:26.571
so the Graph host comes from the
cloud profile, never from the sign-in,

8
00:00:26.571 --> 00:00:29.950
and a check in the linter makes
the workflow agree with it.

9
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:34.610
An unknown cloud name is refused
outright, never mapped to worldwide.
